Subject: [PATCH 4/8] Correct the overfitting diagnostic's claims after
 verification

- Memorization is compared at fixed epochs (mean of epochs 21-30): only a linear head and a
  10x lower learning rate reduce it; the lower selected-epoch gaps of dropout, weight decay and
  MLP 64 came from seeds selected at epochs 1, 12 and 15. Figures and tables use the fixed-epoch
  gap; paired fusion-image differences and parameter-matched pairs added.
- Statements scoped: "within global capacity/regularization, reducing overfitting does not make
  fusion gain"; Macro-F1 and ROC-AUC treated separately; validation AUC rises to 0.53-0.55 by
  epochs 6-10 then fluctuates; under- to over-confidence; confident errors carry 68 % of the
  weighted loss; text-only falls below chance; sign of the experiment-log A/B row fixed.
- Code: a partial diagnostic run needs its own --out_dir; reproduction check ignores line
  endings; serving body limit covers CRLF-wrapped base64; callback test asserts the calls.

